    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_01",
      "hash": "b42e6c6f487cb7ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Your [VAR POKNAME(0003)] looks very promising.\\c\\nI’m pretty sure that [VAR POKNAME(0003)] can learn\\na marvelous move that I’ve developed!\\c\\nDo you want me to teach a marvelous move\\nto [VAR POKNAME(0003)]? What do you say?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_02",
      "hash": "b42e6b6f487cb607",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Hey, you!\\c\\nDo you want me to teach a marvelous move\\nto [VAR POKNAME(0003)]?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_03",
      "hash": "b42e6a6f487cb454",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "Oh, it doesn’t seem to be necessary for your\\n[VAR POKNAME(0003)] to learn a move for now."
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_04",
      "hash": "b42e696f487cb2a1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0000)] wants to learn\\nthe move [VAR MOVE(0001)].\\c\\nShould an old move be forgotten and\\nreplaced with [VAR MOVE(0001)]?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_05",
      "hash": "b42e686f487cb0ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0000)] learned [VAR MOVE(0001)]!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_06",
      "hash": "b42e676f487caf3b",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "One...[WAIT 20]two...[WAIT 20]and...[WAIT 20]ta-da![VAR SFX(0003)][VAR SFX(0000)]\\c\\n[VAR PKNICK(0000)] forgot [VAR MOVE(0002)]!\\c\\nAnd it learned [VAR MOVE(0001)] instead![VAR SFX(0004)][VAR SFX(0001)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_07",
      "hash": "b42e666f487cad88",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0000)] did not learn\\n[VAR MOVE(0001)]."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_08",
      "hash": "b42e656f487cabd5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Build a marvelous relationship with\\nyour Pokémon, OK?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_09",
      "hash": "b42e646f487caa22",
      "flags": 4,
      "text": "I see... If you change your mind, please\\ncome back."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_10",
      "hash": "b42ae76f48799fe4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "Which move would you like?"
